{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c369236be1af07d28e847ee252657c5321b4ec37bdfc39f2001f8fb0916c776",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e8fdd114b8429d1efcca33694e26c64e6e45672b9dda76c409dab2b5c76dec8",
      "text": "青蛙王子的梦…",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c52c840a32b403016b62e56b52c609112238840f699177d7e5553acd202d6180",
      "text": "皮埃尔离开了因政争而陷入混乱的祖国，\n远渡重洋来到了日本。为了给失去笑容的祖国\n重新带回和平，正独自苦思烦恼的他，\n被保镖们带去游乐园散心。\n在那里，皮埃尔发现的是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000022:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000022:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e8fdd114b8429d1efcca33694e26c64e6e45672b9dda76c409dab2b5c76dec8",
      "text": "青蛙王子的梦…",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000024:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a649ec701ef8f83880de4ff6c5b142fd2e071b9cc61cfd7eb982dfee0eba9dd2",
      "text": "某王国的城堡",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59cf4f07e816f7eb7a2bd352d31def13b26b7285e2fac4f029db65b3655ebf76",
      "text": "又是那件事吗……别让我说那么多次！\n大臣们所期望的人选，是我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47141481f6afcdfcd3b5769f3125f760b2c250083ba7f6182c79f33af57e9baf",
      "text": "你说什么，你这家伙怎么可能胜任王位！\n父王若还康健，岂容你如此放肆！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d48a5f54c8b93cdb0bc7ef32feb9a55905c030224dd2064df5c0a2708dc89681",
      "text": "哈，父王如今卧病在床，\n凭你又能做得了什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c46d002991347030f2b77ccb7d2e6d8b31a52164485030676eae93868291d84",
      "text": "给你脸了，你这家伙……！\n给我出去单挑！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f1bf03bd31f6901e8eee1bce3e62e3a1b0e47fc068ed19427bba8c5338796f4",
      "text": "王兄们……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3b530479d17dab7d0e9ad48b9155d77deb40f0b1c56b5376446f991bc70edf0",
      "text": "自从父王倒下后，就总是吵个不停。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fa1d2b4f7eaf4b923f2cd28f9809d1557e74576a27ae48fb8a0cd3d703c74ef",
      "text": "皮埃尔大人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42c051c38a7b5b58de07f7d0c86a21ce2230dacaa168661ff58c6f119607f5de",
      "text": "不仅是王兄们。\n大家全都总是板着生气的脸、悲伤的脸。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:953a95db485f79b6cd3ae9818831963533f0d0979a4f17ddaf0a6de9374014fc",
      "text": "起初是家人们，接着是城堡里的大家。\n然后，城镇上的人们也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:622bb922a46416592b952f61691927e398705a7c5671826c28edbaed1fd51f49",
      "text": "如今，整座国家的笑容都消失了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:014aa6c9f1aaf20b4654e5d10427bb095c76b5a8a0622ea45178387824fd72c8",
      "text": "难道就没有什么，是我能做到的吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31c47e654a73b1e7e686008911b157435fcfc9edfd686bd108a7679ac86fa090",
      "text": "……关于这件事，其实我有话要向您禀报。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0af5d4cb2232e171463f132edfa25e5aea865fe2d6dbf2acf9c2147fe900fc7",
      "text": "话……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24d7e09b3f60f203858cebc8fbaf3815fbc4e3504182c834096117c876228006",
      "text": "如今，这个国家正处于前所未有的混乱之中。\n因此，哪怕只让皮埃尔大人一人逃脱出去也好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c521f9d98faacf44c99eaa81d6a58ebd19c5f42ea9da2071e862425201e1d162",
      "text": "意思是……流亡吗？\n可是，到底要去哪里？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26cede1028d739f5d730ee749b0c1d942938eddda030be052b2c5ddfbf5a3fed",
      "text": "便是王妃殿下从前留学过的东方岛国。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:904ca1de722dd101d4e0bf41bd05ab37d70d998072498625113a2d62407be2a5",
      "text": "是日本对吧？\n以前听母后提起过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7c2b559d0888aca9e65f165f8d6ce2ac687cc81efabc638d37022bd40e2f940",
      "text": "难道说，这件事也是母后拜托你的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c31133fc7b45f369f76b4c0e21a63554b8f9bab079ec02c891f8c1596e0d62ef",
      "text": "是的。不过，王妃殿下会留下来。\n去往日本的，只有皮埃尔大人和几名保镖……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1397f1595fcec9c49eb6610d087e88009b584ca209456e98a66f0414bb091ccc",
      "text": "（……我明白。\n母后是王妃，不能轻易离开国家）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63df2a759be0fe92ac841e965ef722610c321e5b17258192b66681816859ee54",
      "text": "（即便只是个小小的国家，我们也是\n王室的一员……肩负着整个国家）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d88bb1bfe551b4191d6275f5662fc110e73c1293b72f71c7c4c090e26013fd8",
      "text": "（既然这样，我……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99e6da28b9f3e3eea5b3f132e8cc8cfdc0e4a8ffd9ed7efb9318d3d005ee4894",
      "text": "我非常喜欢\n生我养我的这个国家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83603507b79b4e3ec8330c75307744f131d813f82f1256424e0ae9f2cd5b9240",
      "text": "如果可以的话，我不想离开。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fa1d2b4f7eaf4b923f2cd28f9809d1557e74576a27ae48fb8a0cd3d703c74ef",
      "text": "皮埃尔大人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8418cf6c7cf9dfb497625b7398e2f3ac73448a5e9cb4f910e862b39708826ebb",
      "text": "可是……只要拥有王位继承权第三位的我\n留在这里，纷争就会变得更加剧烈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad1240642a7980e7bced276ff4155f7456115e926fbf8e063ae2de4c85d49f32",
      "text": "没错吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88d7caee33809085755b2aea1f80976b048aad5b7ca6c00cb84e5f9d9d0a9d7b",
      "text": "……是的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8d2fc84f53763b2aa7b2ec6071c018d0061936cd868478968f971bdf0bc7a4e",
      "text": "母后曾经说过。\n日本是一个洋溢着笑容的绝妙国度。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:defeee7ac6525a6147e8ea8ed5cffcdc979ed0ac9a30691db7ff0607f9c25065",
      "text": "至少没有像这个国家这样的混乱，\n是一个公认和平的国家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:511315630ccd2481b7dedd0a1c26fb357c947011cf0ec7204fdabd791c2ba5a7",
      "text": "那么，我想去日本学习。\n去学习为了和平，我能做些什么。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43f817ddaac795a4ddb4a5c0541e65e16b40e108a5c7b855b063ae23f91aea98",
      "text": "……走吧，去日本！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_d:cmd-000022:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65143ccc5f7429bbecd890a6120f9f6ce72bd41b65e590663ea5e4ded852b1e8",
      "text": "日本的酒店",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0161e65739645af0a8491946ab88cec8f10588308a6453be78d8f16eb5b9b2c4",
      "text": "（来到这个国家，已经是第3天了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d622963bde59c04eefc8bd485cbffb2ee39fd914c8bcae06fa7d1b02eb393325",
      "text": "（没有认识的人，语言和文化也不同。\n……好寂寞啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e828d807ac7834743b41ea4dd35434a6c59f146a115e357b06c06ce8114139d4",
      "text": "（这个国家，好和平。\n怎样才能让我的国家也变成这样呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89b553c07f72e833301cc183cfc917315a3586f819a989ebd3f414939cc7fb56",
      "text": "皮埃尔大人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f37837666e2112ddcea67f4c8b820cc10702e4a12bcff573db06bad707b1593",
      "text": "咦？那朵花是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b66d29156043c7519c8f893b520e1f7bf9c9056df9d223d1bde7388057cd20b4",
      "text": "附近的商店街里有一家花店。\n我想着一定要献给皮埃尔大人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc0ddec8736807deb95f7668d17e55ebf3b51c340010ec18c18ba3d9e5133047",
      "text": "这样啊……是什么花呢？\n总觉得和城堡庭园里开的花很像……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:636cd7ef5af5993a40d0d81303387a338379d9086b2c91cbbae5e31b16a68454",
      "text": "那个，皮埃尔大人……\n如果可以的话，要不要外出走走？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5742e0ca30c67272f9157f4d2316cb2e8c939f8652fda060d2333057c47cabcf",
      "text": "诶，为什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66d4ca09cc3acabe1d14bf29fc1ea20f963b8a19637f21b5eeb227627998a8f1",
      "text": "一直闷在房间里对身体不好，\n而且目前也没有发现追兵的踪迹。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b241a41c59200d80d2bb5d52004afe26f6e6822301bf59cf0443f0f9588eae48",
      "text": "当然，无论发生什么，\n我们都会全力保护您的安全！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a6cefb13c6325534f78de30488dce9f82a2c169e78e3c16ea5d1fe3d7867aa9",
      "text": "这里就是游乐园……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c149c1504aa276c1bdd958711fda2bff0fcaa1115b910c4111cf17e7a36e6c3b",
      "text": "呀——！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a81ed2443dbe206d83a734e47b146bcd9b918f3b299e02728934e6e405a028b",
      "text": "什、什么！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3f2102e802d09d83e8642020d6d5de992b9172c23e08ac6d2379f73660b3c59",
      "text": "那叫做过山车，\n是乘坐高速矿车体验刺激的项目。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e21175e81b7deba1b5b3834261fb03970ee104b5310d3494c292101eae42c747",
      "text": "叫得那么大声，\n出来的人们却全都在笑呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb60de6b768673c94196e217125c045c89b92bfc2bf8cd7fc497986e7e15730b",
      "text": "呐，我想坐那个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d20dd97cc3b6ad0cd0be61a9b6e3ee02298cf3001fd9a42c99c53c287043258f",
      "text": "皮、皮埃尔大人要去坐那个……！？\n非常抱歉，属下无法准许。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26bbd3275e40dccee1a7966b4c680758f0204029bdfe434e641de26312b352c5",
      "text": "诶诶，为什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:590bdae7279ebb6280f614ada5a5490e8aab8e95a268adbe7e25ca27150405be",
      "text": "因为一旦发生万一，\n很难确保皮埃尔大人的安全。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f5e0168dd3d9d2afa143a2a02e6f9a754e92a2630e565fd890bd660957ecfe3",
      "text": "怎么这样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1501030dd4f24a2e792214e3042c09db4415ae0a755a0285f61f32024853e87",
      "text": "唔……我知道了。\n那我们去找看起来比较安全的东西吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:feed685d8d193b4ea298fcaa092b252fb8be49847a5f70b90e2845ed215c35ac",
      "text": "呐，那栋大宅子呢？\n去那里的话应该能安全地玩了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_f:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f32056b68a6f974e68001a854e3f82c94048c83ad23bf04799b510b3d3d66c4f",
      "text": "鬼屋吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:593e90c0ec3aa07dbace587407b1a9130f870bc22c52c97ef90cd6d1634f2d1d",
      "text": "宅子里视野极差，而且\n也有可能突然出现什么未知的人或物……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d54e00ba3f284e98d7a5a0787eb34237dd4380ac223fd4e1e061488c9ca7b7e",
      "text": "不行……对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f09f683d108c88cd0ddaaea74335cd689db1592628dabb9cd1752534028ec971",
      "text": "呜呜……非常抱歉！那么，\n那边的旋转木马如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_f:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91bd3375f127841ed177948762874088cde283fb369af6aa4f96bb722dfabba9",
      "text": "（马的游乐设施……\n说起来，以前经常和家人一起去骑马呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_f:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0397fd8d4063516a7de91b9b3cca8e33adb12a939fdd300e879bdc017dbcd0a8",
      "text": "（那时候王兄们和家人们也全都在笑……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa1a683d021ba63d919b95364714cb0113e4b3f9dafbb3162ffa46fbc25bef9d",
      "text": "……皮埃尔大人？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e327eb3f2af3b68b5d3cec3bdedb767d3dd051cad2c9804667b42dffccce0ce7",
      "text": "对、对不起！\n坐设施之前，我想先去一下洗手间！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_f:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a6e28e479ecb93d44694fe1575c8bd66441275cae511a52bd710ad362dcc169",
      "text": "那么，我们也一起！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_f:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ab880830edd092ae8baa823f4508df2981ab2bf2cea6d7e44315505be9f6b69",
      "text": "真是的，我又不是小孩子了。\n我一个人没问题的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efba021d82112e9b1cb6a5f4f70134390ee115dc330440585c9ad63ce212d8e9",
      "text": "那么，属下就在这里恭候您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e9689f554ddaed37865fcb4b844fafb9efe42041aeca0779c15e3ebff4f7f78",
      "text": "嗯！马上就回来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_g:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b7c7bfecf61d6ce8bd1736b02b1b25807aa69e2e0e1d4b4ac79e35969481235",
      "text": "（……太好了。\n要是露出这副表情，大家会更担心的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b467919549c45fbd28f29ed2c26beb30163f229ee602193b5fb284f567140d3",
      "text": "这边，这边！快点——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_g:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:383061c600c8f1e4f637c0d750fc35e455c08ed8d09c1fcf564cb9455a093e50",
      "text": "哎呀哎呀，别急。\n游乐设施又不会跑掉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_g:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a",
      "text": "好——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d960e6b6fe51fc8419081baa4ec7d5fdad11ecbedabb07bec1150323d3653e91",
      "text": "（这里洋溢着这么多的笑容。\n可是，我却……什么都做不到……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_g:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_g:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b140b0488838e14dfe94a84dd14ed2951517416d8369fb070d906a55322a610",
      "text": "哇……！\n好、好大一只熊……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_h:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c091417729f5eaada9c9f68b4049a81982254858ca8834c9060543468a29040",
      "text": "气球……？\n这个，是要送给我的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cff071299b646902efbf13d6177d6eaa081e39f00b36206391907ad8d8e6d2f",
      "text": "哇！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_h:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27aa539c6b2723b770ed38d490bd8aca77bdb2fc59e68eda23a00fcff9e500ef",
      "text": "（拥、拥抱！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:370d01fc70edca1cb5350023e5f962080bf2f2747bc50cc7659f27a2fb156e35",
      "text": "（咦？……好神奇。\n暖洋洋的，毛茸茸的，感觉好安心……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5462ea30bf96dabbfc090ec5e670d929841ddf606a989d04e6c0de9e24380ca8",
      "text": "皮埃尔大人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_h:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ec75cc254ca3f9e193a581e98baf7bda9b11ff1c220a00da385d15e4510b964",
      "text": "您这么久没回来属下很担心。\n难道这家伙对您做了什么……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:419d173a0640985a7502b860a4da2ed38ef11e7678601f6a817d22264094316d",
      "text": "就是这个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:331f675a95fe655d1bb3f9685ec7e70e15e76338802e720b26601f57df1d3d10",
      "text": "怎、怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_h:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae746d2114b78cfcf09d12ed09bb0fd9375cae290bf3649148955df8a701a0d4",
      "text": "就算语言不通，也能让别人露出笑容……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_h:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d25e408385503f8f732f0919f2d6f302ff283ffdbb320e57aeae6f365b21f1b0",
      "text": "我要变成这只熊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_h:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd633da1a5fd433efdb576a15c2c14217a5f12d924641488c6d8e1619b179c88",
      "text": "诶……诶诶！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0aebb25b8cca3cb06ba94396f6a518e21f1482fdc8ec859845b51835b2b6bda8",
      "text": "一国王子竟然要去打工……\n而且，居然还是穿人偶装打工……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22d9e2719be0f349525180547bd02631081bd4af117b02271087d65ce0c22117",
      "text": "正因为是一国王子才要去啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:672aace2e45d47b683648f1c8fbd1359b32eca4c93740c4724e02e77a854d2d1",
      "text": "我想让哪怕多一个人露出笑容。\n只要大家都能笑起来，世界一定就能迎来和平！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e027fffe360bf7c44e05c36c7b5efd7c83543185c2dd2106e48c1aa736b418e0",
      "text": "所以……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e36448b3879c5cd4d4d4e38d250970e3fa8a98368fb4f27c0faf2043f5f8eb11",
      "text": "属下虽明白皮埃尔大人的志向，\n但考虑到您作为一国王子的立场……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90e41a3613d20cd6f6a69fb08a308347eba23dfa82e0eb80886b27b86f7cdcdf",
      "text": "在这个国家，我既不是王子也不是什么大人物。\n只是普通的皮埃尔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6677aad124959b010d84891004774b0aeb9bead9e72547a278f7d64f99b24eb5",
      "text": "根本没有必要去在意立场吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e9ba118f1396a5e83cd139e6575f4142861a7c99900b2349476bb5520f5f9c4",
      "text": "而且，我听说母后留学的时候，也曾偷偷\n在可丽饼店打过工呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf97a86e89f14fa8d0d2858642aff358a82d7ecc61b74043fecbbb8f350f0f6c",
      "text": "什、什么！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:731777f9b9e1fe14f340109fbff41ab2eed3f0d64eb2c2887f2c51d833ce6bb0",
      "text": "她说在那里遇到了很多人，\n学到了许许多多的事情……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffd37557933c96ae61c7bf146a27153fe205426310d590121e7eb890a553683b",
      "text": "我觉得母后送我出来，\n也一定是想让我像那样去学习各种东西的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8b3a64851a3249954384d76ba907387a6bbe6d2e41e5899eb6892c1cc9fad41",
      "text": "……属下明白了。\n但是，有一个条件。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdbd46c1fdbffccafacd31871210b4ed45084045c219237be5aa804758828d05",
      "text": "条件？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_j:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_j:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1188a1225febf3f95d6de84bdb31b330538d8722c7ce7421c2f283afa9b4ad3",
      "text": "哇，是青蛙先生——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bfe995e3b37ed46786869875dd9b14d56444c590258d989da32de3575c17f1c",
      "text": "你……你好！\n这、这个给你，请收下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f23daff2982d4f17ec480aa7ff0f15221af2edc13406b1666ed24d81d4b99de2",
      "text": "要送我气球吗？\n太好啦！谢谢你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb7c1abaff8b271bad39bb88c8d8c4a0cf8445c12a587a7465b1bcc77788df58",
      "text": "叔叔们也是青蛙先生的朋友吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_j:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_j:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1d31117ffebc4a6feb1ac93acb4475cb6f3b5eca822c46bf86d58dc7282484a",
      "text": "……！（连连点头）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_j:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05d3a9a43a89fd43ac75b57769ff3c4c1f4be88f71b9c4d8148dddbc5e7cf5b5",
      "text": "青蛙先生好用力地点头了！\n果然是朋友啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_j:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcf00151bcb1cc916885571bcded616e57194b1b3daf0e625e49316ba87b4175",
      "text": "（“打工的时候，\n必须在我们的视线范围内”……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_j:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:665a77eaee2ca83d9ebc4dd4b665485091ead07faaf232b0ff65cc5ca565a868",
      "text": "（虽然感觉有点引人注目，\n但也只能这样啦）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfd06274768165ee07a0df91113b8d8cb1dbd46463b5734fea6518624f5708e1",
      "text": "再见啦，青蛙先生！还有朋友叔叔！\n呱呱～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc4710ed572cc1f2083ed0e3d7980577749f9b9eb9b659ded688755bf302583e",
      "text": "……！\n呱、呱呱～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_j:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d98a6888576a9140a8e5349e259df89b476a52038315dcc34f3070abf25f790",
      "text": "（太好啦……！\n我让那个女孩子笑出来了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_j:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1f2ec5bbb9e22aa9539f6aa82ab4f84ed0f62170bfce59baba04925c0d56d22",
      "text": "（在语言不通的国家里的第一次打工……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_j:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c05aa2b8980b3d3840e1064249b7ed80617467a09c9a9c308ba51dca8fd28fd0",
      "text": "（这就是我的梦想……通往世界和平的第一步！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
